\]
Then the rotated point has \(y\)-coordinate
\[
\frac{\sqrt3 t+t^2-4}{2}
=\frac{3-\sqrt{57}}2.
\]
So \(a=3,\ b=57,\ c=2\), and
\[
a+b+c=62.
\]

